   "whatsnew": "with EssentiaTD installed, a new Analysis page draws the audio's beats on the timeline, shows its BPM and key, and can draw a curve (loudness, brightness, onset strength and more) and a heatmap (spectrogram, notes, timbre) behind the timeline and in the Animation editor; Lock Results keeps the analysis in the project for machines without the plugin. the background keeps its shape when a layer is hidden; turning the waveform or markers down could squeeze the heatmap and the other layers into a different aspect. the waveform draws the audio that plays after a movie is unloaded; it kept drawing the old movie's soundtrack. picking or dropping an audio file (or an audio operator) while the movie's soundtrack is in use switches to your audio; it used to keep playing and drawing the movie's. Play Audio (on by default) plays the timeline audio through an Audio Device Out kept in the project's media host, on the Audio Driver and Audio Device you pick on the Timeline page; until now a loaded song or movie was silent unless you wired one yourself.",
