   "whatsnew": "the licence key, the licence product, the update endpoints (Base URL, Gate URL) and the store folder no longer travel between projects through the settings file; Active, Use Discovery, Show Progress, Show Notes and Keep Store still do. new quick-launch command Install agent skill copies the FNSTools agent skill into the project (.claude/skills/fnstools) or the user skills folder, idempotent by version; a store refresh now also fetches the skill bundle and lays it out beside the FNS family folder in the palette. when an update finishes replacing packages, the Hub's toolbar, navbar and main-menu group brackets are re-placed around the settled bar, and the updater tells the Hub while a pass is still replacing packages so no group is dropped mid-update.",
